  summary: { title: 'Your code can decide', sub: 'if · elif · else · truthiness', text: `<p><code>if</code>/<code>elif</code>/<code>else</code> pick exactly one path (first True wins). Empty values are falsy. Prefer flat conditions with <code>and</code>/<code>or</code>, and use <code>A if cond else B</code> for simple choices.</p>` },
